== Effects ==
* Adds a 50% chance for [[Devil Room|Devil Deals]], {{R|Black Market}}s, and {{I|A Pound of Flesh}} {{R|Shop}} items to cost [[Coins|money]] instead of [[health]].
** Items that would normally cost 1 [[Health#Red Heart Containers|heart container]] will cost 15 coins, while items that would normally cost 2 heart containers will cost 30 coins.

== Notes ==
* The effects of this trinket are inherent to {{c|Keeper}} and {{c|Tainted Keeper}}, rendering the trinket useless for them.
* Items affected by Keeper's Bargain may occasionally be discounted (30 coin item down to 15 coins, or 15 coins to 7), just like items are in a regular shop.
* Dropping this trinket while in the room disables its effect.
* Purchasing a [[Devil Room|Devil Deal]] with this trinket's effect will still prevent {{R|Angel Room}}s from appearing.
* If an item that costs health is rerolled (via {{i|The D6}} or similar methods), the new item can cost coins instead. The reverse is also true.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: The chance for deals to cost money is 100%. Having both makes the deals have an increased chance to be on sale.

== Interactions ==
* {{T|Judas' Tongue}}: Does not provide any discount.
* {{C|The Lost}}/{{C|Tainted Lost}}/{{P|Soul of the Lost}}: Purchasing items affected by this trinket will not cause the other items in the room to disappear.

